                <ul>
                    <li>Tool-free connection of rigid and flexible wires with wire end ferrule</li>
                    <li>Easy connection of flexible wires without wire end ferrule by opening the terminals</li>
                    <li>Lightning protection necessary</li>
                    <li>One operation lever for opening both connecting terminals</li>
                    <li>For triggering the lever and disconnecting of wires you can use the same tool (Screwdriver according to DIN ISO 2380-1 Form A 0.8 x 4 mm (0.0315 x 0.157 in))</li>
                    <li>DIN ISO 8764-1 P21 e 4.5 mm (0.177 in)</li>
                    <li>Constant spring force on terminal point independent of the applied wire type, wire size or ambient conditions (e.g. vibrations or temperature changes)</li>
